00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,180
May this AI system ship?

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,700
May this AI system ship? And what is the evidence?

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,400
FairMind answers it with one reviewable record.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:17,300
Find the AI you have not registered. Discovery reads MLflow, GitHub and Hugging Face.

5
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:25,000
Every system, against every release check. Live. Click a cell to see what is behind it.

6
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:32,850
109 evaluations. 104 can run today. Each with its metric, its threshold and its engine.

7
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:40,700
Every result becomes evidence. Where it came from, and how much it counts.

8
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:48,550
A release gate scores every check. And explains how the verdict was reached.

9
00:00:48,630 --> 00:00:55,850
The result is evidence. A person decides. Someone other than the person who asked.

10
00:00:56,100 --> 00:01:03,000
